.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt FUTEX 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm futex
.Nd wait on or wake a futex
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft isize
.Fn futex "const u32 *addr" "u32 op" "u32 val" "u64 timeout_ns"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call waits on or wakes the futex at .Fa addr according to .Fa op.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
